  "reason": {
    "need": "No claimed goal loses a check that this exam really provided (see claims). Road traffic and spreadsheet modelling have dedicated exams in all Länder. The free-fall experiment has its dedicated exam in Hesse and Saxony only; in the other Länder it had none before and has none now, because this exam never asked for an experiment.",
    "fit": "25 points, pass mark 15, four steps of 6, 7, 6 and 6 points: any one step can be left out entirely. Steps 1 and 2 evaluate a given table for a uniformly accelerated motion; step 3 calculates a free fall from given values; step 4 calculates a stopping distance, which belongs to E.2 since the E.1 cut.",
